# The suite reads checked-in files and compares them — tests match README
# code blocks against doctested copies, compare embedded literals with shipped
# `.game` fixtures, and scan source for banned tokens. A checkout whose line
# endings depend on the cloner's `core.autocrlf` (the Windows default) makes
# every one of those inputs differ by platform. `text=auto` keeps anything
# binary untouched; `eol=lf` pins text to what this repository stores.
* text=auto eol=lf
